  one low-degree vertex; a rainbow version), 2610.03729 (every polyhedral graph is schurian), 2610.24758 (necklace
  graph Hamiltonicity), 2610.06289 (primitive circular permutations), 2610.05776 (Wythoff-type rows), 2610.07442,
